sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Patient as Patient (User)
    participant UI as Next.js Cockpit (Vercel)
    participant API as FastAPI Gateway
    participant Agent as LangGraph Orchestrator
    participant DB as PostgreSQL / EHR
    participant Verifier as OutcomeVerifier

    Patient->>UI: Enters message ("Reschedule to Friday 2 PM")
    UI->>API: POST /api/chat {message, patient_id}
    API->>DB: Take Baseline Snapshot (State T0)
    API->>Agent: ainvoke(AgentState)
    Agent->>Agent: Request Classification (RESCHEDULE)
    Agent->>Agent: Safety Guardrails Check (PASS)
    Agent->>DB: Execute reschedule_appointment(APT-1001, new_slot)
    DB-->>Agent: Appointment updated in SQL transaction
    Agent->>Agent: Final Response Synthesis + AgentClaim
    Agent-->>API: {response_text, agent_claim, trace_steps}
    API->>DB: Take Post-Execution Snapshot (State T1)
    API->>Verifier: verify(claim, State T0, State T1)
    Verifier->>Verifier: Compute State Diff & Validate Match
    Verifier-->>API: VerificationResult (COMPLETED, discrepancy=False)
    API-->>UI: Complete Payload {response, verification, trace, latency}
    UI-->>Patient: Displays confirmed reschedule with Verified Badge
